# Without this, a `COPY . ` build context includes every build artifact in the
# repo. For meshql-rs that is 83G of `target` plus 41G of agent worktrees on a
# ~150G tree — copied once per consuming service, which does not fail so much as
# never finish. eclectic builds seven services from this context.
target/
**/target/
.worktrees/
.git/
node_modules/
*.log
